==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Mooth]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 0.07~0.33 seconds<sup>2f~10f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns as the boss after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*50 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 0.07~0.33 seconds<sup>2f~10f</sup>.
*50 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns.
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns.
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] to kill the Mooths, then use your money wisely as well as spawning constant [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cats]] when you can to kill Gory Groom. 3 Dagshunds spawn when the base is hit, so it is also wise to bring [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] along with you. Use [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] for the Sir Seals if you are for some reason worried about them, and bring a general [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attacker]] like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]].

